  "operatingOrder": [
    "load full stage screenplay",
    "expand all 8 gender/outcome variants",
    "freeze exact storyboard action for every cell",
    "attach real cast image files",
    "P0 gate: every actor's real image bytes must be attached, otherwise BLOCKED (path strings do not count)",
    "P0 prompt: prepend mandatory absolute textless/cast-identity/canonical-scene rules to every shot and variant render prompt",
    "independently render one native-resolution 16:9 WebP per canonical scene with real character master bytes (if image generator connected)",
    "assemble approved native WebP frames into 2-column x up-to-3-row lossless review-only sheets (up to 5; never use a low-resolution contact sheet as the original)",
    "for bulk review queues: at most 50 authentic independent WebPs, 10 sheets of up to 5, with deterministic batch indices; do not pad stage2's 48 canonically defined scenes",
    "if a native high-res input sheet is supplied, cut only when per-cell native pixels exceed minimum; otherwise BLOCKED_LOW_RES",
    "check native pixels and provenance",
    "review each cell vs its exact screenplay and approved reference",
    "register only approved individual files",
    "P0 visual review: REJECT any incorrect cast, UI/text/number, narrative mismatch or low-quality source; no autopromote",
    "deploy after all variant checks pass"
